window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Dragons exist, and I’m one of them. Only, I’m not alone. From the moment the stubborn military man shifted into a dragon, everything changed. Now, I’m torn between two men: one that my dragon claims, and one that my heart claims.</p> <p>Except, I wish my heart was my only worry.</p> <p>An enemy dragon is drawn to my scent. He’s stalking me each and every moment. If he reaches me again, I don’t know that I’ll be able to escape him for a second time.</p> <p>So, I need to keep running, from my heart, and a terrifying enemy that wants me for his own.</p> <p><i>Surge of Heat</i> is the second book in a very steamy paranormal reverse harem romance. This book has so much yummy goodness, but I don’t want to spoil it.</p>"; 
